      "post_id": "81019",
      "author_handle": "kristag",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "I've seen this terminology pop up a few times now but really don't fully get this.  What is it exactly and how does your baby lead you with weaning?\nFrom what I can gather, it's something to do with just given them 'chunks' of food, not puree or blending.\nAnyone actually done that?  It seems to go against everything the HVs tell you  🤔",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8593/#81019",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/a92d0e40da5dc5ff7a3a.html",
      "page_url": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8593/",
      "role": "original_post",
      "original_post_id": "81019"
    },
    {
      "post_id": "81024",
      "author_handle": "candgsmum",
      "date_as_displayed": "Posted 17 years 5 months ago",
      "body": "I googled and found this\nhttp://babyledweaning.com/\nHTH x",
      "permalink": "https://www.justparents.co.uk/forums/topic-8593/#81024",
      "raw_file": "_raw/forums-deep/justparents/responses/a92d0e40da5dc5ff7a3a.html",
