      "body": "[QUOTE FROM ANOTHER POST]\ncandgsmum said:\nI googled and found this\nhttp://babyledweaning.com/\nHTH x\n[/QUOTE]\nAh, so it is just missing the puree'd phase.\nJust thought I'd ask.  Happy weaning Sophie as I'm doing and did the same for Jasmine and she's a fine young lady 🙂  Just heard it bandied about a bit lately about this child led stuff.",
